# game/ch09.rpy:15
translate english ch9_736e68fe:

    # n "周四傍晚，爸爸妈妈还没下班，阿狐独自在家写作业。妈妈手机突然响起，来电显示一串陌生号码。"
    n "Thursday evening. Mom and Dad were still at work; Ahu was home alone doing homework. Mom's phone suddenly rang from a strange number."

# game/ch09.rpy:16
translate english ch9_b91430ca:

    # n "阿狐帮妈妈接起电话。"
    n "Ahu answered for Mom."

# game/ch09.rpy:17
translate english ch9_be8fe1a1:

    # l9_cop serious "你好，我是市公安局刑侦大队李警官，警号072156。你的手机卡涉嫌一起特大洗钱案，现在需要你配合调查！"
    l9_cop serious "Hello, this is Officer Li from the city police criminal investigation unit, badge number 072156. Your phone card is involved in a major money-laundering case. You must cooperate with our investigation now!"

# game/ch09.rpy:18
translate english ch9_f17acf59:

    # think confused "洗钱？我只是个小学生呀……可对方连警号都报了，听起来好正经……"
    think confused "Money laundering? I'm just an elementary schooler... But he even gave a badge number. He sounds so official..."

# game/ch09.rpy:21
translate english ch9_b0dac0f4:

    # l9_cop serious "根据法律规定，涉嫌人员必须配合调查，泄露案情要负法律责任！你叫什么名字？家里大人做什么工作的？"
    l9_cop serious "By law, suspects must cooperate with investigations — leaking case details has legal consequences! What's your name? What do the adults in your family do?"

# game/ch09.rpy:35
translate english ch9_A_c3d4ddc3:

    # n "「洗钱案」三个字听得阿狐心跳加速，但他猛然想起老师反诈课上的话。"
    n "The words \"money laundering\" made Ahu's heart race — but he suddenly remembered his teacher's words from the anti-fraud class."

# game/ch09.rpy:36
translate english ch9_A_6c5b2c58:

    # think serious "老师说过：公检法机关绝不会打电话办案，更不会让老百姓转账！这是骗局！"
    think serious "Teacher said: police, prosecutors, and courts NEVER handle cases by phone, and never make people transfer money! This is a scam!"

# game/ch09.rpy:37
translate english ch9_A_ef461a86:

    # mc serious "警察叔叔不会打电话让我配合调查，你是假的，我挂了！"
    mc serious "Real police don't call kids to \"cooperate with investigations\". You're fake — I'm hanging up!"

# game/ch09.rpy:38
translate english ch9_A_c62750f8:

    # n "阿狐挂断电话，把陌生号码拉黑，并第一时间给妈妈打电话说明情况。"
    n "Ahu hung up, blocked the number, and called Mom right away to explain."

# game/ch09.rpy:39
translate english ch9_A_e2663b77:

    # mom serious "做得对！妈妈马上拨打96110反诈专线核实——这类号码正是诈骗电话，妈一会儿就把骚扰拦截打开。"
    mom serious "Well done! Mom immediately called the 96110 anti-fraud hotline to verify — the number was indeed a scam line. She turned on spam blocking too."

# game/ch09.rpy:42
translate english ch9_A_9e78b1e7:

    # police laugh "反应非常快！真警察办案会当面出示证件、做笔录，绝不会电话里要求转账或「配合调查」。陌生电话谈案件，一律先挂断！"
    police laugh "Lightning-fast reactions! Real police show credentials in person and take statements in person — they never demand transfers or \"cooperation\" by phone. Any strange call about a case: hang up first!"

# game/ch09.rpy:54
translate english ch9_B_eb11e1f3:

    # mc confused "我是个小学生，怎么可能洗钱？到底是什么案子？"
    mc confused "I'm an elementary schooler — how could I launder money? What case is this exactly?"

# game/ch09.rpy:55
translate english ch9_B_c5fb4ff2:

    # l9_cop serious "你的身份信息被犯罪团伙冒用，开通的电话卡发送了大量诈骗短信！现在有两条路：一是配合资金清查自证清白，二是明天由当地民警上门逮捕你！"
    l9_cop serious "A criminal gang stole your identity and used a phone card under your name to send scam texts! Two options: cooperate with a funds check to clear your name, or local officers arrest you tomorrow!"

# game/ch09.rpy:56
translate english ch9_B_f8178f9a:

    # n "紧接着，「李警官」发来一张带照片的「刑事拘捕令」，阿狐的名字和照片赫然在列，还盖着鲜红的大印。"
    n "Then \"Officer Li\" sent a \"criminal arrest warrant\" with a photo — Ahu's name and picture on it, stamped with a bright red seal."

# game/ch09.rpy:57
translate english ch9_B_35199720:

    # l9_cop serious "此案属于机密！不准告诉任何人，包括你父母，否则以泄密罪论处！现在开始视频做笔录，全程不许挂断！"
    l9_cop serious "This case is classified! Tell no one — including your parents — or face charges of leaking secrets! Start a video statement now and do not hang up!"

# game/ch09.rpy:71
translate english ch9_B1_8670a0c4:

    # n "阿狐越听越害怕，但「不准告诉父母」这句话反而让他起了疑心。"
    n "The more Ahu heard, the scarier it got — but \"don't tell your parents\" only made him suspicious."

# game/ch09.rpy:72
translate english ch9_B1_5544dd9a:

    # think worried "让我瞒着爸妈的「警察」，为什么这么怕大人知道？不对劲！"
    think worried "A \"policeman\" ordering me to hide it from my parents — why is he so afraid of adults finding out? Something's wrong!"

# game/ch09.rpy:73
translate english ch9_B1_0a223f99:

    # n "阿狐没有挂断电话，借口写作业，偷偷给妈妈发了消息。妈妈立刻打来电话，让他什么都不用做，马上拨打96110。"
    n "Ahu didn't hang up — pretending to do homework, he secretly messaged Mom. She called back at once: do nothing, dial 96110 right now."

# game/ch09.rpy:74
translate english ch9_B1_b0d8a9f0:

    # mom serious "宝贝，这是「冒充公检法」诈骗！通缉令是P的图，公安机关办案从不保密到不许告诉家人，更不会电话办案！"
    mom serious "Sweetie, this is the \"fake police\" scam! That warrant is photoshopped. Real police never keep cases so secret you can't even tell family — and never handle cases by phone!"

# game/ch09.rpy:75
translate english ch9_B1_978ea1a0:

    # n "妈妈陪阿狐拉黑号码、开启拦截，还拨打了96110备案。"
    n "Mom helped Ahu block the number, enable filtering, and file a report with 96110."

# game/ch09.rpy:78
translate english ch9_B1_ce5c0f9b:

    # police laugh "关键一步走对了！凡是让你「保密」「不许告诉家人」的「警察」，百分之百是骗子！反诈专线96110，随时帮您核实！"
    police laugh "That was the crucial move! Any \"policeman\" demanding \"secrecy\" or \"no telling your family\" is a scammer, one hundred percent! The 96110 hotline is always there to verify!"

# game/ch09.rpy:90
translate english ch9_B2_50a425ad:

    # n "阿狐盯着那张「通缉令」看了半天，忽然发现不对劲。"
    n "Ahu studied the \"warrant\" for a long moment — then suddenly spotted something off."

# game/ch09.rpy:91
translate english ch9_B2_35aab925:

    # think serious "真通缉令怎么会用手机发过来？照片还是我班级群里的头像！老师说过，公检法办案都是当面出示证件！"
    think serious "Since when are warrants sent by phone? And the photo is my class-group avatar! Teacher said police always show credentials in person!"

# game/ch09.rpy:92
translate english ch9_B2_96764763:

    # mc serious "我不配合。真警察不会电话办案，更不会用微信发通缉令，你是骗子！"
    mc serious "I won't cooperate. Real police don't work cases by phone, and never send warrants over chat apps. You're a scammer!"

# game/ch09.rpy:93
translate english ch9_B2_f01cafc8:

    # n "阿狐挂断电话并拉黑号码。对方又换了两个号码打来，都被拦截了。"
    n "Ahu hung up and blocked the number. The scammer tried two more numbers — both filtered."

# game/ch09.rpy:94
translate english ch9_B2_5f7c4f59:

    # n "晚上妈妈回家，阿狐说明了情况，妈妈立刻拨打了96110备案，并开启了全家骚扰拦截。"
    n "When Mom got home, Ahu explained everything. She immediately filed with 96110 and turned on spam blocking for the whole family."

# game/ch09.rpy:97
translate english ch9_B2_dd5f0802:

    # police serious "识破PS通缉令，干得漂亮！记住三个「绝不会」：公检法绝不会电话办案、绝不会发「安全账户」、绝不会让你瞒着家人。"
    police serious "Seeing through the photoshopped warrant — beautifully done! Remember three \"nevers\": police never work cases by phone, never use \"safe accounts\", never make you hide things from family."

# game/ch09.rpy:109
translate english ch9_B3_75436351:

    # n "看着盖着红章的「通缉令」，阿狐吓坏了，按对方要求开始了「视频笔录」。"
    n "Terrified by the red-stamped \"warrant\", Ahu started the \"video statement\" as instructed."

# game/ch09.rpy:110
translate english ch9_B3_216f2949:

    # n "对方逐一询问了家庭住址、爸爸妈妈的工作单位、银行卡信息，还让他下载了一个「办案协作APP」开启屏幕共享。"
    n "The scammer asked for the home address, his parents' employers, bank card details — and had him download a \"case cooperation APP\" with screen sharing."

# game/ch09.rpy:111
translate english ch9_B3_dd43a844:

    # n "视频里，「李警官」突然要求：把妈妈手机收到的银行验证码报给他，「清查资金流水，证明清白」。"
    n "Mid-video, \"Officer Li\" suddenly demanded: read out the bank verification code on Mom's phone to \"check the fund flow and prove your innocence\"."

# game/ch09.rpy:112
translate english ch9_B3_2c0b7b15:

    # n "就在这时，妈妈提前下班回了家，一把抢过手机挂断了视频。"
    n "Just then, Mom came home early from work, snatched the phone, and ended the video."

# game/ch09.rpy:113
translate english ch9_B3_2077d073:

    # mom serious "这是诈骗！验证码差点就被骗走，银行卡里的钱就危险了！"
    mom serious "It's a scam! The verification code was almost stolen — the money in that card was in danger!"

# game/ch09.rpy:114
translate english ch9_B3_8070abd5:

    # n "妈妈立刻修改了银行密码、解绑快捷支付，并拨打了96110备案。"
    n "Mom immediately changed the bank password, unlinked quick payment, and filed with 96110."

# game/ch09.rpy:117
translate english ch9_B3_89ea7a2b:

    # police serious "好险！个人信息、银行卡号已经泄露，好在验证码没给出去。「屏幕共享」等于把银行卡摊在骗子眼皮底下，一个验证码都发不得！"
    police serious "Close call! Personal info and card numbers leaked, but the verification code didn't. \"Screen sharing\" lays your bank card bare before the scammer — never send a single code!"

# game/ch09.rpy:129
translate english ch9_C_42ca9529:

    # n "阿狐不敢怠慢，把家庭情况一一交代了。"
    n "Not daring to stall, Ahu answered everything about his family."

# game/ch09.rpy:130
translate english ch9_C_7736e2fe:

    # think worried "警察叔叔的问题我都老实回答了，应该很快就能证明清白吧……"
    think worried "I answered the officer's questions honestly — my name should be cleared soon... right?"

# game/ch09.rpy:131
translate english ch9_C_a09cb0d2:

    # l9_cop serious "初步查明，你妈妈银行卡里的资金有问题！为了证明清白，需要把存款转入「安全账户」进行资金公证，查完原路退还！"
    l9_cop serious "Preliminary findings: there's a problem with the funds in your mother's bank account! To prove innocence, transfer the deposits to a \"safe account\" for notarization — everything comes back after the check!"

# game/ch09.rpy:132
translate english ch9_C_b650c60c:

    # l9_cop serious "马上下载「资金清查APP」，打开屏幕共享，我一步步教你操作！记住，此案高度保密，不许告诉任何人！"
    l9_cop serious "Download the \"Funds Check APP\" now and turn on screen sharing — I'll walk you through it! Remember, this case is highly classified. Tell no one!"

# game/ch09.rpy:146
translate english ch9_C1_8a7353a0:

    # n "手指即将点下下载按钮，阿狐心里突然咯噔一下。"
    n "Just as his finger reached the download button, Ahu's heart suddenly skipped."

# game/ch09.rpy:147
translate english ch9_C1_250871fd:

    # think serious "等等！老师说过，根本没有「安全账户」，公检法办案也不会视频指导转账！越是不让告诉家人的，越是骗子！"
    think serious "Wait! Teacher said \"safe accounts\" don't exist, and police never guide transfers by video! The more they forbid telling family, the more certain it's a scam!"

# game/ch09.rpy:148
translate english ch9_C1_28f3466a:

    # mc serious "我不下载！真警察有意见请上门找我爸爸，或者我们打96110核实，你敢报真名吗？"
    mc serious "I'm not downloading it! If you're real police, come to our door for my dad — or let's verify with 96110. Do you dare give your real name?"

# game/ch09.rpy:149
translate english ch9_C1_7057008d:

    # n "电话那头瞬间哑口无言，随即挂断。阿狐马上给妈妈打电话，妈妈拨打了96110备案并开启拦截。"
    n "The other end went speechless and hung up. Ahu called Mom at once; she filed with 96110 and enabled blocking."

# game/ch09.rpy:152
translate english ch9_C1_062c6a9e:

    # police serious "反应出色！「安全账户」是冒充公检法骗局的核心话术——记住：让你转账的「警察」都是骗子，96110才是真正的反诈热线！"
    police serious "Outstanding reflexes! The \"safe account\" is the core script of fake-police scams — remember: any \"policeman\" telling you to transfer is a scammer. 96110 is the real anti-fraud hotline!"

# game/ch09.rpy:164
translate english ch9_C2_ae839c3d:

    # n "阿狐既怕被「逮捕」，又不敢下载奇怪的APP，决定先报银行卡号「配合一下」。"
    n "Afraid of \"arrest\" yet unwilling to download the strange APP, Ahu decided to give just the card number to \"cooperate a little\"."

# game/ch09.rpy:165
translate english ch9_C2_17bc3cb3:

    # think laugh "只给卡号，不给密码不给验证码，应该出不了事吧。"
    think laugh "Just the card number — no password, no code. Nothing can go wrong, right?"

# game/ch09.rpy:166
translate english ch9_C2_da429bd6:

    # n "卡号报过去，「李警官」却步步紧逼：流水显示异常，需提供短信验证码完成「资金公证」，否则今晚就上门拘捕。"
    n "After the card number, \"Officer Li\" pressed harder: the records show anomalies — provide the SMS verification code to complete \"fund notarization\", or officers arrest you at your door tonight."

# game/ch09.rpy:167
translate english ch9_C2_cfbf4bdc:

    # mc confused "怎么问完卡号又要验证码？越问越深了……"
    mc confused "Card number given, now they want the code? This is going deeper and deeper..."

# game/ch09.rpy:168
translate english ch9_C2_c662a3ac:

    # n "阿狐慌忙挂断电话找妈妈。妈妈立刻挂失补办银行卡、修改所有支付密码。"
    n "Ahu hung up in a panic and found Mom. She immediately reported the card lost, replaced it, and changed every payment password."

# game/ch09.rpy:169
translate english ch9_C2_85236d91:

    # n "所幸验证码没有泄露，卡里的钱保住了，但办卡、换卡折腾了整整一周。"
    n "Thankfully the code never leaked and the money was safe — but replacing the card took a whole week of hassle."

# game/ch09.rpy:172
translate english ch9_C2_bd7ea9d2:

    # police serious "卡号、身份证号都会被骗子利用！面对冒充公检法，正确的动作只有一个：挂断电话，拨打96110，告诉家人。侥幸心理要不得！"
    police serious "Scammers can use card numbers and ID numbers! Against fake police there's only one correct move: hang up, dial 96110, tell your family. Don't gamble on luck!"

# game/ch09.rpy:184
translate english ch9_C3_aad3125e:

    # n "阿狐被「今晚拘捕」吓坏了，乖乖下载了「资金清查APP」，打开屏幕共享。"
    n "Terrified by \"arrest tonight\", Ahu obediently downloaded the \"Funds Check APP\" and turned on screen sharing."

# game/ch09.rpy:185
translate english ch9_C3_59acb774:

    # n "屏幕共享状态下，「李警官」一步步指挥他：输入妈妈手机的支付密码、读出刚收到的验证码、确认「资金公证」转账。"
    n "With the screen shared, \"Officer Li\" directed him step by step: enter Mom's payment password, read out the fresh verification codes, confirm the \"fund notarization\" transfer."

# game/ch09.rpy:186
translate english ch9_C3_8436367b:

    # n "几分钟后，妈妈卡里的48000元被分三笔转走。电话挂断，「李警官」再也联系不上。"
    n "Minutes later, 48,000 yuan left Mom's card in three transfers. The call ended — and \"Officer Li\" could never be reached again."

# game/ch09.rpy:187
translate english ch9_C3_0dc2f8f2:

    # mc sad "妈妈……妈妈的钱被我在电话里转走了……我该怎么办……"
    mc sad "Mom... I transferred your money over the phone... What do I do...?"

# game/ch09.rpy:188
translate english ch9_C3_00ec6813:

    # n "妈妈回家后，阿狐哭着说明了经过。妈妈没有责骂他，立刻报警并联系银行冻结账户，但大部分钱已被转走。"
    n "When Mom got home, Ahu explained through tears. She didn't scold him — she reported to the police and froze the accounts at once, but most of the money was already gone."

# game/ch09.rpy:189
translate english ch9_C3_32a69ad3:

    # mom normal "不怪你，是骗子太狡猾。记住：以后凡是电话里谈到钱和密码的，一律挂断，等妈妈回来。"
    mom normal "It's not your fault — the scammer was cunning. Remember: from now on, any call involving money or passwords gets hung up until Mom is back."

# game/ch09.rpy:192
translate english ch9_C3_ecc54b76:

    # police serious "小朋友记住！「冒充公检法」是损失最惨重的骗局：假警官、假通缉令、假安全账户，最后用屏幕共享掏空你的银行卡。真警察从不电话办案，96110永远为你核实！"
    police serious "Kids, remember! \"Fake police\" scams cause the heaviest losses: a fake officer, a fake warrant, a fake safe account — then screen sharing empties your bank card. Real police never work cases by phone, and 96110 will always verify for you!"

